    p2Situation: 'A first-year university student from another province is looking for the best place to live during their freshman year. Three accommodation options are available: (A) Living in the university dormitory on campus, (B) Renting a private apartment alone, or (C) Living with distant relatives in the city. Which option do you recommend?',
